  "description": "# Seoul\n\n**SEL · v0.4.0**\n\nCustom map of Seoul, Korea, built from official Korean government transport and demographic data.\n\n## Coverage\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><td><strong>Region</strong></td><td>경기도, 서울특별시, 인천광역시</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Playable Area</strong></td><td>1,732 km²</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<details>\n<summary>District list (49)</summary>\n\n<table style=\"width: auto\">\n<tr><th align=\"left\">시군구</th><th align=\"left\">District</th><th align=\"right\">Population</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\"><strong>경기도 (Gyeonggi-do)</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>고양시 덕양구</td><td>Deogyang-gu Goyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">544,794</td></tr>\n<tr><td>고양시 일산동구</td><td>Ilsandong-gu Goyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">297,093</td></tr>\n<tr><td>고양시 일산서구</td><td>Ilsanseo-gu Goyang-si</td><td align=\"right\">175,044</td></tr>\n<tr><td>과천시</td><td>Gwacheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">59,886</td></tr>\n<tr><td>광명시</td><td>Gwangmyeong-si</td><td align=\"right\">302,390</td></tr>\n<tr><td>광주시</td><td>Gwangju-si</td><td align=\"right\">31,260</td></tr>\n<tr><td>구리시</td><td>Guri-si</td><td align=\"right\">185,982</td></tr>\n<tr><td>김포시</td><td>Gimpo-si</td><td align=\"right\">51,817</td></tr>\n<tr><td>남양주시</td><td>Namyangju-si</td><td align=\"right\">397,527</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부천시 소사구</td><td>Sosa-gu Bucheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">224,842</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부천시 오정구</td><td>Ojeong-gu Bucheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">203,515</td></tr>\n<tr><td>부천시 원미구</td><td>Wonmi-gu Bucheon-si</td><td align=\"right\">405,093</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 분당구</td><td>Bundang-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">258,925</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 수정구</td><td>Sujeong-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">557,765</td></tr>\n<tr><td>성남시 중원구</td><td>Jungwon-gu Seongnam-si</td><td align=\"right\">919,893</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수원시 권선구</td><td>Gwonseon-gu Suwon-si</td><td align=\"right\">121,580</td></tr>\n<tr><td>수원시 팔달구</td><td>Paldal-gu Suwon-si</td><td align=\"right\"